<h1 data-copy-en="Kasumi" data-copy-zh="Kasumi">Kasumi</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Reputation milestones, Garden Walk, Queenstone and worker upgrades." data-copy-zh="声誉节点、庭园漫步、女王石与员工升级。">Reputation milestones, Garden Walk, Queenstone and worker upgrades.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">在哪里找到</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系节点</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">常见卡点</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Queenstone_Bonding"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="One-Time_Resort_Group_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sunset_Walk_with_Kasumi_2"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sunset_Walk_with_Kasumi"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sirena_Isle_Vacation_Activities"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Two_Crafted_Training_Upgrades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Shadow_Arts_Apprentice"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Garden_Walk_Date"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Daily_Talk_and_Reassurance"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recommended_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Meeting_and_Recruitment"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Kasumi — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/kasumi.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Kasumi — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/kasumi.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Kasumi — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Kasumi’s useful milestones are her reputation events, Garden Walk, Queenstone bonding and later worker training upgrades. Her ordinary portrait and shared event hours are different.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Where to find them</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Place</th><th scope="col">Portrait hours</th><th scope="col">Condition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The Bar</th><td data-label="Portrait hours">15:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Condition">—</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Recruit Brandy to open the Bar entrance. Kasumi’s own reputation-10 recruitment event happens at Rose &amp; Thorn’s entrance and does not itself replace that Bar unlock.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Story_Beat_39_and_Precognition"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Return to Rose &amp; Thorn’s entrance at reputation 6, 8 and 10 for her three separately registered events. The reputation-10 event recruits her; its current condition does not add a personal affection requirement.</p><p>Garden Walk needs Friend (100) and begins at the Bar from 15:00–17:00. Queenstone bonding needs In Love (3000) and that stone in your key items, 60 minutes once a day.</p><details><summary>Optional reference: personal and shared event navigation</summary><p>Each listed event happens once. Return to the named place after completing its prior steps. Completion affection is a base reward; dialogue choices can add further affection. The scenes and choice answers remain in the game.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Event</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base completion affection</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">A Desperate Request</th><td data-label="Requirements">Rose &amp; Thorn; Rose &amp; Thorn reputation 6; Elara, Kasumi not on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Kasumi +10; Elara +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Haunted by Visions</th><td data-label="Requirements">Rose &amp; Thorn; Rose &amp; Thorn reputation 8; Kasumi not on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Kasumi +15</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Oracle's Choice</th><td data-label="Requirements">Rose &amp; Thorn; Rose &amp; Thorn reputation 10; Kasumi not on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Kasumi +20</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Kasumi Demonstrates Shadow Arts</th><td data-label="Requirements">The Bar; 20:00–24:00; Shadow Known (25); 8, 20 recruited; Kasumi, Shadow not on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Kasumi +4; Shadow +4</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Worker_Gifts_and_Clothing"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Worker_Visits_and_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Bar_Performance_Reaction"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / usable start time</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / normal limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">The Bar; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">20 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+1 base affection; 4/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Garden Walk</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">The Bar; Friend (100); 15:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; −20 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once; +8 base affection on event completion</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Intimate Bonding</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">The Bar; In Love (3000); own Queenstone</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">Queenstone level +1; 1/day</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Her resort conversations and two permanent worker upgrades are additional activities after the normal recruitment route. Check the separate tables for the gifts and exact conditions.</p><details><summary>Optional reference: permanent worker upgrades</summary><p>Each upgrade doubles the experience of its own training and adds +50% worker income. The two income bonuses add together. Carry the required crafted gift; it is consumed.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Conditions / start time</th><th scope="col">Cost</th><th scope="col">Reward</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">No Instructions Required</th><td data-label="Conditions / start time">The Bar; Kasumi In Love (3000); Garden Walk with Kasumi; Kasumi not on vacation; 15:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Cost">0 min; consumes 1 Hexbound Rose Sachet</td><td data-label="Reward">permanent training upgrade; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Future Can Wait</th><td data-label="Conditions / start time">The Bar; Kasumi In Love (3000); Kasumi: Sunset Walk with Kasumi; Kasumi not on vacation; 15:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Cost">0 min; consumes 1 Prismatic Spell Brooch</td><td data-label="Reward">permanent training upgrade; once</td></tr></tbody></table></details><details><summary>Optional reference: resort activities</summary><p>Assign her to vacation through Worker Rooms first. Resort portraits are rolled on arrival, so she is not guaranteed at every stop. Use the resort-specific menu while she is there.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Activity</th><th scope="col">Place / hours</th><th scope="col">Time / reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk</th><td data-label="Place / hours">07:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Time / reward / limit">15 min; +1 base affection; 6/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Eat together</th><td data-label="Place / hours">Sirena Isle Buffet 11:00–16:00</td><td data-label="Time / reward / limit">60 min; 1/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Relax together</th><td data-label="Place / hours">Sirena Isle Beach 08:00–16:00</td><td data-label="Time / reward / limit">60 min; 1/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Private beach time</th><td data-label="Place / hours">Sirena Isle Beach 10:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Time / reward / limit">60 min; +50 base affection; 1/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Spa evening</th><td data-label="Place / hours">Sirena Isle Spa 19:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Time / reward / limit">60 min; 1/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Sunset walk H2H</th><td data-label="Place / hours">Sirena Isle Beach 17:00–20:00</td><td data-label="Time / reward / limit">60 min; 1/day, repeatable on later days</td></tr></tbody></table><p><a href="game-systems-sirena-isle-resort.html">Resort access and shared rewards</a></p></details><details><summary>Optional reference: affection bonuses</summary><p>Each favorite-stat threshold adds 1 to ordinary base affection before other bonuses; the favorite skill doubles the adjusted base. Direct rewards remain the listed direct amount.</p><p>Charm 80; Communication 70; Perception 76</p><p>Favorite skill: Spirit Communication</p></details><p>Start windows exclude their ending hour. Costs are base values; applicable skills and active bonuses may change them. Base affection, direct affection and NPC intimacy experience are distinct. Dialogue choices can add rewards beyond the listed event-completion base.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Troubleshooting"></span><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>For the reputation events, return to the entrance; the normal Bar portrait does not substitute for that location.</li><li>For bonding, bring Queenstone specifically; another Soul Stone does not satisfy it.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="character-brandy.html">Brandy and Bar access</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-brothel.html">Workers and training</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-soul-stones.html">Soul Stones</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-sirena-isle-resort.html">Resort</a></li><li><a href="locations.html">Location reference</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-story-beats.html">Story navigation</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Queenstone_Bonding"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-One-Time_Resort_Group_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sunset_Walk_with_Kasumi_2"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sunset_Walk_with_Kasumi"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sirena_Isle_Vacation_Activities"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Two_Crafted_Training_Upgrades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Shadow_Arts_Apprentice"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Garden_Walk_Date"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Daily_Talk_and_Reassurance"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recommended_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Meeting_and_Recruitment"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Kasumi 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/kasumi.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Kasumi 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/kasumi.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Kasumi 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Kasumi 的实用节点包括声誉事件、庭园漫步、女王石羁绊，以及后续员工训练升级。常规肖像与共同事件使用不同的时段。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>在哪里找到</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">肖像在场时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">酒吧</th><td data-label="肖像在场时段">15:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">—</td></tr></tbody></table><p>酒吧入口由招募 Brandy 开放。Kasumi 自己的声誉 10 招募事件发生在玫瑰与荆棘入口，并不会代替酒吧的开放条件。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Story_Beat_39_and_Precognition"></span><h2>路线与关系节点</h2><p>玫瑰与荆棘声誉达到 6、8、10 时，可回到入口查看她的三个独立事件。声誉 10 的事件完成后招募她，当前条件没有另加个人好感度要求。</p><p>庭园漫步要求朋友（100），从酒吧 15:00–17:00 开始。女王石羁绊要求恋爱中（3000）并持有该关键物品，耗时 60 分钟，每天一次。</p><details><summary>可选查阅：个人与共同事件的触发条件</summary><p>下列事件均为一次性内容。完成前置后，请返回对应地点。完成好感度列为基础奖励，对话选择还可能追加好感度。剧情与选项答案请在游戏中体验。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">事件</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">完成基础好感度</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">迫切请求</th><td data-label="条件">玫瑰与荆棘; 玫瑰与荆棘声誉 6; Elara, Kasumi 未在度假</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Kasumi +10; Elara +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">被幻象纠缠</th><td data-label="条件">玫瑰与荆棘; 玫瑰与荆棘声誉 8; Kasumi 未在度假</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Kasumi +15</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">神谕者的选择</th><td data-label="条件">玫瑰与荆棘; 玫瑰与荆棘声誉 10; Kasumi 未在度假</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Kasumi +20</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Kasumi展示潜行暗技</th><td data-label="条件">酒吧; 20:00–24:00; Shadow 已知 (25); 8, 20 已招募; Kasumi, Shadow 未在度假</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Kasumi +4; Shadow +4</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Worker_Gifts_and_Clothing"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Worker_Visits_and_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Bar_Performance_Reaction"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／可开始时间</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／常规次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">交谈</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">酒吧; 陌生人 (0)</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">20 分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+1 基础好感度; 4次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">庭园漫步</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">酒吧; 朋友 (100); 15:00–17:00</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120 分钟; −20 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性; +8 事件完成基础好感度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">亲密羁绊</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">酒吧; 恋爱中 (3000); 持有女王石</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60 分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">女王石等级 +1；1次/日</td></tr></tbody></table><p>正常招募后还有度假谈话及两项永久员工升级。指定礼物与确切条件见各表。</p><details><summary>可选查阅：永久员工升级</summary><p>每项升级使对应训练的经验翻倍，并增加 50% 员工收入；两项收入加成相加。需携带指定的制作礼物，并会消耗礼物。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗</th><th scope="col">奖励</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">无需说明书</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">酒吧; Kasumi 恋爱中 (3000); 花园漫步与 Kasumi; Kasumi 未在度假; 15:00–18:00</td><td data-label="消耗">0 分钟；消耗 1 咒缚玫瑰香囊</td><td data-label="奖励">永久训练升级；一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">未来可以等</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">酒吧; Kasumi 恋爱中 (3000); Kasumi: 和 Kasumi 的日落散步; Kasumi 未在度假; 15:00–18:00</td><td data-label="消耗">0 分钟；消耗 1 棱彩法术胸针</td><td data-label="奖励">永久训练升级；一次性</td></tr></tbody></table></details><details><summary>可选查阅：度假村活动</summary><p>先通过员工房间安排她度假。抵达度假地点时才判定遇见谁，并非每次都能见到她。在那里遇见时，请使用度假专用菜单。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">活动</th><th scope="col">地点／时段</th><th scope="col">耗时／奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">交谈</th><td data-label="地点／时段">07:00–23:00</td><td data-label="耗时／奖励／次数">15 分钟；基础好感度 +1；6次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">一起用餐</th><td data-label="地点／时段">塞壬岛自助餐 11:00–16:00</td><td data-label="耗时／奖励／次数">60 分钟；1次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">一起放松</th><td data-label="地点／时段">塞壬岛海滩 08:00–16:00</td><td data-label="耗时／奖励／次数">60 分钟；1次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">海滩私人相聚</th><td data-label="地点／时段">塞壬岛海滩 10:00–18:00</td><td data-label="耗时／奖励／次数">60 分钟；基础好感度 +50；1次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">夜间水疗</th><td data-label="地点／时段">塞壬岛水疗馆 19:00–23:00</td><td data-label="耗时／奖励／次数">60 分钟；1次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">日落散步谈心</th><td data-label="地点／时段">塞壬岛海滩 17:00–20:00</td><td data-label="耗时／奖励／次数">60 分钟；1次/日，可在之后的日子重复</td></tr></tbody></table><p><a href="game-systems-sirena-isle-resort.html">度假村入口与共同奖励</a></p></details><details><summary>可选查阅：好感度加成</summary><p>每达到一项偏好属性门槛，普通好感度计算的基础值增加 1；偏好技能会将调整后的基础值翻倍。直接奖励仍按标明的直接数值加入。</p><p>魅力 80; 沟通 70; 感知 76</p><p>偏好技能：灵体沟通</p></details><p>开始时段不包含结束整点。消耗为基础值，适用技能与当前加成可能改变实际数值。基础好感度、直接好感度与 NPC 亲密经验分别计算；对话选择还可能在事件完成基础奖励之外追加奖励。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Troubleshooting"></span><h2>常见卡点</h2><ul><li>声誉事件要回到入口，常规酒吧肖像不能代替该地点。</li><li>羁绊要求女王石，其他灵魂石不能代替。</li></ul></section>
